<title>JAPAN: Diamond Lease - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Diamond Lease - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		159.69		vs	  164.46</p>
<p> Operating	    2.18		vs	    2.76</p>
<p> Current		1.23		vs	    1.48</p>
<p> Net		  762    million    vs	  751    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.01 yen	  vs	   19.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Diamond Lease Co Ltd is a leasing company affiliated with Mitsubishi Bank Ltd.</p>
